From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PiBridge <noreply@pibridge.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] nvkms: use 2Heads1OR for VR headsets wider than
 single-head DSC allows

Single-head DSC is limited to a picture width of 5120 (nvt_dsc_pps.c); a
wider mode needs dual DSC, i.e. 2Heads1OR. nvEvoUse2Heads1OR() only picks
2Heads1OR when the pixel clock exceeds one head's maximum, so a VR headset
whose wide mode fits one head's pixel clock (the Pimax Crystal Super's
7104x3840 modes, 2028 / 2564 MHz) fails the DP bandwidth check (HBR3 x4,
DSC 8.0 bpp needed). Use 2Heads1OR for a VR HMD (isVrHmd: RM's "direct mode
display" answer for the EDID's vendor/product) wider than 5120.

GPUs: RTX 20/30/40 (Turing, Ampere, Ada: merge-mode HALs). On RTX 50
(Blackwell) supportsMergeMode is FALSE and nvEvoUse2Heads1OR() returns
before this check, so it does nothing there; the Crystal Super on RTX 50
needs the FEC re-read patch instead (blackwell/).
Headset: Pimax Crystal Super (any VR HMD wider than 5120).
Driver: 595.99.02.
Status: UNTESTED on hardware. Compiled and loaded on an RTX 5090 only,
where the code path is never reached. Not tried on an RTX 20/30/40.

License: MIT OR GPL-2.0, as open-gpu-kernel-modules.
---
 src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo.c b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo.c
index 7a2ffd1..eb96c77 100644
--- a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo.c
+++ b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo.c
@@ -9855,6 +9855,15 @@ NvBool nvEvoUse2Heads1OR(const NVDpyEvoRec *pDpyEvo,
         return FALSE;
     }
 
+    /* A VR headset wider than single-head DSC allows (pic_width <= 5120,
+     * nvt_dsc_pps.c) needs dual DSC, i.e. 2Heads1OR, even when one head could
+     * drive its pixel clock: the Pimax Crystal Super's 7104x3840 modes
+     * (2028 / 2564 MHz) can fit one head, and without this its only modes
+     * fail the DP bandwidth check (HBR3 x4, DSC 8.0 bpp needed). */
+    if (pDpyEvo->isVrHmd && (nvEvoVisibleWidth(pTimings) > 5120)) {
+        return TRUE;
+    }
+
     /* Use 2Heads1OR mode only if the required pixel clock is greater than the
      * maximum pixel clock support by a head. */
     return (pTimings->pixelClock > pHeadCaps->maxPClkKHz);
